# This repo lives inside the live PoE2 game directory, which also holds save data,
# game config and downloaded NeverSink base filters. So this is an ALLOWLIST:
# ignore everything, then un-ignore only the filter project.
#
# Add a new tracked file by adding a matching "!" line below. Anything not listed
# here stays out of the repo permanently.

*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md

# The filter itself (generated, but committed so the repo is usable as-is)
!FinancialAdvisor Filter.filter

# Build pipeline - the actual source of truth
!_filter-build-script.awk
!_filter-economy-update.ps1

# Custom drop sounds referenced by the filter
!hibdivine.mp3
!HibOmenLight.mp3
!Echoes.mp3
!OmenOfTheLiege.mp3
!OrbOfAnnulment.ogg
!OrbOfAnnulment.mp3
!OrbOfAnnulment-audio-process.md
!Install-FinancialAdvisorFilter.ps1
!Install-FinancialAdvisorFilter.cmd
!FinancialAdvisorFilterSetup.cs
!FinancialAdvisorFilterSetup.exe
!FinancialAdvisorFilterUpdater.cs
!FinancialAdvisorFilterVersion.cs
!Build-FinancialAdvisorSetup.ps1

# Explicitly excluded even though they sit beside the tracked files:
#   *.bak, *.bak-*            previous builds
#   _filter-economy-update.log run history
#   _filter-cache/            intermediate build output
#   OnlineFilters/            NeverSink base filters downloaded by the game
#   poe2_production*          game config, mtx and save data
#   LocalSave/ EShop/ ETrade/ BuildPlanner/ PassiveKeywordSearch/
